Modifications (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b))

  The files changed or added after the first commit are the modifications made
  in this repository. The complete list, with the nature of every change, is
  available from version control:

      git diff --stat eb8ef11 HEAD

  In summary:
    - Added: the communication simulator, bandwidth models, transmission
      plans, aggregation rules, assignment and selection policies and their
      self-tests (fedml_api/standalone/superfednas/comm_sim/); the search-phase
      runner (fedml_experiments/standalone/superfednas/search_phase.py); the
      SLURM scripts (cluster/); the deadline-sweep analysis (analysis/).
    - Modified: the SuperFedNAS trainer, client trainers, server models and
      command-line arguments, to integrate the above; the FedAvg and FedNAS
      entry points, to run them under a round deadline; the CIFAR-10 and
      CIFAR-100 data loaders.

